1
00:00:56,320 --> 00:01:02,624
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:05,855 --> 00:01:07,286
As Your Highness knows best,

3
00:01:07,641 --> 00:01:09,934
my greatest strength is that

4
00:01:10,696 --> 00:01:13,612
I'm a quick learner.

5
00:01:22,935 --> 00:01:25,160
Do you know what else Miss Zhang is into?

6
00:01:27,266 --> 00:01:28,880
She likes

7
00:01:33,314 --> 00:01:36,447
watching the losers strip off their clothes one by one

8
00:01:39,401 --> 00:01:41,935
until they're totally naked.

9
00:01:54,649 --> 00:01:57,062
Are you worried I won't get the hang of it, Your Highness?

10
00:02:06,504 --> 00:02:08,263
There's nothing

11
00:02:08,423 --> 00:02:10,600
you can't learn, Censor Shen.

12
00:02:17,105 --> 00:02:18,838
You sure know how to bend and adapt.

13
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:21,480
For someone you care about, you're willing to learn anything.

14
00:02:21,632 --> 00:02:23,392
Too bad all this flattery and pleasing

15
00:02:23,545 --> 00:02:25,118
won't stay exciting for long.

16
00:02:25,330 --> 00:02:27,290
Miss Zhang will probably get bored in a few days.

17
00:02:28,664 --> 00:02:29,771
Yes.

18
00:02:30,545 --> 00:02:33,866
You are quick to push me away because you are bored.

19
00:02:34,097 --> 00:02:35,510
When did I ever say I was...

20
00:02:45,608 --> 00:02:48,295
You didn't finish your sentence. That means you like me.

21
00:02:49,665 --> 00:02:50,919
Who likes you?

22
00:02:52,913 --> 00:02:54,594
You don't like me anyway.

23
00:02:54,705 --> 00:02:55,960
I have no choice.

24
00:02:56,224 --> 00:02:58,856
I guess I'll just pick someone random.

25
00:02:59,705 --> 00:03:01,380
Life goes by fast anyway.

26
00:03:04,145 --> 00:03:05,382
How dare you?

27
00:03:07,201 --> 00:03:09,135
Of course I wouldn't dare with you here.

28
00:03:09,904 --> 00:03:11,401
Your heart is full of twists and turns.

29
00:03:11,425 --> 00:03:12,959
You always keep things hidden inside.

30
00:03:13,312 --> 00:03:15,677
I'm already used to you keeping things from me.

31
00:03:16,129 --> 00:03:17,984
After all, you've kept

32
00:03:18,393 --> 00:03:19,927
plenty of secrets from me.

33
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:24,359
So, it doesn't really matter.

34
00:03:25,673 --> 00:03:27,086
What are you getting at?

35
00:03:28,128 --> 00:03:29,423
When do you plan to tell me

36
00:03:29,944 --> 00:03:31,959
about the Seventh Prince, Your Highness?

37
00:03:35,224 --> 00:03:36,656
The Seventh Prince.

38
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,934
How did you find out?

39
00:03:40,104 --> 00:03:42,118
You already knew who Le Sheng really is.

40
00:03:45,544 --> 00:03:48,758
The Ye Dynasty Illustrated Almanac that His Majesty can't stop praising.

41
00:03:50,304 --> 00:03:51,988
I once saw it at Le Sheng's place.

42
00:03:55,494 --> 00:03:56,998
I even know

43
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:59,514
that the noble who's supporting those from humble families

44
00:03:59,538 --> 00:04:01,031
is actually you, Your Highness.

45
00:04:05,361 --> 00:04:06,920
I can't hide anything from you, can I?

46
00:04:07,095 --> 00:04:08,655
But I'm not as noble as you imagine.

47
00:04:08,772 --> 00:04:10,546
Raising useful people

48
00:04:10,701 --> 00:04:13,085
is just keeping my options open.

49
00:04:13,744 --> 00:04:15,664
A true gentleman judges actions, not intentions.

50
00:04:15,793 --> 00:04:18,200
Helping those from humble families

51
00:04:18,394 --> 00:04:19,928
is a good deed.

52
00:04:20,136 --> 00:04:21,870
I only figured it out recently.

53
00:04:22,384 --> 00:04:24,680
You're not in the Crown Prince's faction,

54
00:04:25,217 --> 00:04:26,800
and you don't care about the Second Prince.

55
00:04:26,824 --> 00:04:28,118
Everything you've done

56
00:04:28,505 --> 00:04:30,518
has been to support the Seventh Prince.

57
00:04:31,625 --> 00:04:33,638
Since you already know,

58
00:04:34,224 --> 00:04:36,479
are you willing to help Le Sheng out?

59
00:04:36,744 --> 00:04:40,020
If it's for Le Sheng, I'll definitely give him my full support.

60
00:04:40,233 --> 00:04:41,470
But Your Highness...

61
00:04:43,224 --> 00:04:46,103
You've gone through so much to support the Seventh Prince.

62
00:04:46,544 --> 00:04:49,186
Is it really for the glory of serving the future king

63
00:04:49,327 --> 00:04:52,183
or do you have your own motives?

64
00:04:56,223 --> 00:04:57,638
Of course I have my own motives.

65
00:04:58,352 --> 00:05:00,320
I want people like me

66
00:05:01,009 --> 00:05:02,702
to stop living under someone else's mercy

67
00:05:03,145 --> 00:05:04,862
like drifting weeds.

68
00:05:06,084 --> 00:05:07,321
I believe

69
00:05:07,945 --> 00:05:09,518
Le Sheng will be a wise ruler.

70
00:05:13,344 --> 00:05:14,581
What you want

71
00:05:15,017 --> 00:05:17,263
is what countless people like Shen Xiao want.

72
00:05:17,529 --> 00:05:18,766
If that's the case,

73
00:05:19,505 --> 00:05:21,636
I will give you my full support.

74
00:05:21,945 --> 00:05:23,785
The Crown Prince's granary is located

75
00:05:23,912 --> 00:05:25,446
30 miles east of Qianfo Mountain.

76
00:05:25,658 --> 00:05:27,978
- Do you still dare to steal from it? - I wouldn't dare.

77
00:05:28,945 --> 00:05:30,920
This time, we need a safer plan.

78
00:05:31,304 --> 00:05:34,013
Then I'll wait for your good news, Censor Shen.

79
00:05:40,449 --> 00:05:41,686
(Your Highness.)

80
00:05:42,265 --> 00:05:44,118
(I've already learned your motives.)

81
00:05:44,688 --> 00:05:46,103
(But when will you ever)

82
00:05:46,584 --> 00:05:48,418
(notice my motives?)

83
00:05:58,344 --> 00:06:00,719
Hurry. I have urgent news for the Crown Prince.

84
00:06:04,185 --> 00:06:05,223
What is it?

85
00:06:06,081 --> 00:06:07,571
The granary in the western suburbs was attacked.

86
00:06:07,595 --> 00:06:10,526
Last night, Shen Xiao raided it with men from the Ministry of Revenue.

87
00:06:19,904 --> 00:06:23,824
There were a full 500,000 bushels of grain in this unclaimed granary!

88
00:06:23,927 --> 00:06:27,286
Even the grains meant for the Yongtong Canal were hidden there.

89
00:06:27,609 --> 00:06:29,049
People are barely surviving.

90
00:06:29,168 --> 00:06:31,382
But some are still pocketing the profits.

91
00:06:31,744 --> 00:06:33,878
Tell me! Who stole the grains?

92
00:06:45,426 --> 00:06:46,663
Crown Prince.

93
00:06:46,744 --> 00:06:49,305
Why are the grains given by the Ministry of Revenue

94
00:06:49,401 --> 00:06:50,815
to Yongtong Canal in that granary?

95
00:06:55,945 --> 00:06:57,182
Father.

96
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:00,001
This is suspicious. The grains might not have come from the canal.

97
00:07:00,105 --> 00:07:02,305
Maybe it was a mistake made by the Ministry of Revenue.

98
00:07:02,383 --> 00:07:03,943
Please investigate this matter, Father.

99
00:07:04,694 --> 00:07:07,375
Father, the grains were signed off by Lord Cui.

100
00:07:07,478 --> 00:07:09,478
It has nothing to do with the Ministry of Revenue.

101
00:07:09,784 --> 00:07:11,021
Enough!

102
00:07:11,145 --> 00:07:14,318
You two just keep blaming and attacking each other!

103
00:07:20,344 --> 00:07:21,581
Your Majesty.

104
00:07:26,085 --> 00:07:28,263
I am willing to investigate these unclaimed grains

105
00:07:28,344 --> 00:07:30,920
to give the people an explanation.

106
00:07:35,162 --> 00:07:36,399
Good.

107
00:07:36,904 --> 00:07:39,953
I'll now promote you to a fifth-rank Secretarial Censor.

108
00:07:40,065 --> 00:07:42,625
Assist the Three Judicial Offices in investigating this case.

109
00:07:42,744 --> 00:07:44,597
Make sure to get to the bottom of it.

110
00:07:45,224 --> 00:07:47,118
As your command, Your Majesty.

111
00:07:48,984 --> 00:07:51,078
As your command, Your Majesty.

112
00:08:06,744 --> 00:08:08,119
Father wants an investigation.

113
00:08:08,785 --> 00:08:10,225
How are you planning to investigate?

114
00:08:14,312 --> 00:08:15,880
How are we supposed to investigate this?

115
00:08:15,904 --> 00:08:17,199
We can't investigate it.

116
00:08:18,024 --> 00:08:19,261
I...

117
00:08:20,878 --> 00:08:23,684
Your Highness. Right now, all we can do is stall.

118
00:08:23,765 --> 00:08:25,897
The Three Judicial Offices will take turns investigating it. It'll...

119
00:08:25,921 --> 00:08:26,949
We can't stall.

120
00:08:27,061 --> 00:08:29,721
Have you forgotten how angry His Majesty was today?

121
00:08:29,817 --> 00:08:32,484
If we keep stalling, His Majesty will only get angrier.

122
00:08:32,583 --> 00:08:33,623
This...

123
00:08:33,744 --> 00:08:34,981
Come in.

124
00:08:42,616 --> 00:08:43,802
Your Highness.

125
00:08:44,593 --> 00:08:46,153
I'm the one in charge of grain affairs.

126
00:08:46,419 --> 00:08:49,162
If you hand me over, this case will be closed.

127
00:08:49,945 --> 00:08:52,958
My only wish is that my family can be treated kindly.

128
00:08:56,310 --> 00:08:57,547
Alright.

129
00:08:58,386 --> 00:09:00,546
The Eastern Palace will take good care of your family.

130
00:09:02,016 --> 00:09:03,253
Everyone.

131
00:09:03,825 --> 00:09:05,876
Learn from Jin Zhi.

132
00:09:06,923 --> 00:09:08,959
Yes, we should.

133
00:09:09,199 --> 00:09:10,894
As your command, Your Highness.

134
00:09:16,494 --> 00:09:18,872
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

135
00:09:26,288 --> 00:09:28,368
Why didn't you come to the Princess Residence today?

136
00:09:29,545 --> 00:09:32,700
Grain Supervisor Cai from Yongtong Canal turned himself in.

137
00:09:32,825 --> 00:09:34,062
I need to interrogate him.

138
00:09:34,649 --> 00:09:36,529
He's just the scapegoat for the Eastern Palace.

139
00:09:36,624 --> 00:09:39,142
If you interrogate him now, what can you even get out of him?

140
00:09:40,704 --> 00:09:42,064
If he implicates the Crown Prince,

141
00:09:42,144 --> 00:09:43,879
the Crown Prince can't escape blame.

142
00:09:44,025 --> 00:09:45,518
He won't talk.

143
00:09:45,952 --> 00:09:47,192
Even if he does,

144
00:09:47,307 --> 00:09:49,428
one confession can't bring down the Crown Prince.

145
00:09:49,545 --> 00:09:50,927
I have my own way.

146
00:09:52,216 --> 00:09:55,030
The heir to the throne embezzled 500,000 bushels of grains

147
00:09:55,145 --> 00:09:56,968
and treats people's lives like they're nothing.

148
00:09:56,992 --> 00:09:58,232
I'll get to the bottom of this.

149
00:09:58,305 --> 00:10:01,024
The grains are back in the national treasury, enough to save many.

150
00:10:01,104 --> 00:10:02,584
The Crown Prince has lost some favor.

151
00:10:02,624 --> 00:10:04,440
We've done everything we needed to do.

152
00:10:04,553 --> 00:10:06,120
This case can be closed now.

153
00:10:06,432 --> 00:10:09,627
If we keep pushing, you're forcing the Crown Prince to go after you.

154
00:10:11,056 --> 00:10:12,936
I'll investigate this case even if it kills me.

155
00:10:17,936 --> 00:10:19,216
(Shen Xiao.)

156
00:10:19,305 --> 00:10:21,480
(Do you think I don't want to take down the Crown Prince?)

157
00:10:21,504 --> 00:10:22,840
(I want it more than anyone.)

158
00:10:22,952 --> 00:10:24,967
(But what I want even more is to strike true.)

159
00:10:25,048 --> 00:10:28,102
(I'm waiting for a chance to completely bring down the Crown Prince.)

160
00:10:32,304 --> 00:10:34,989
Now, we have nothing left to worry about.

161
00:10:35,088 --> 00:10:37,046
- Yes. - As expected of Prince Consort Cui.

162
00:10:38,392 --> 00:10:40,862
Censor Shen, you came at the perfect time.

163
00:10:41,504 --> 00:10:44,519
Supervisor Cai has confessed to the corruption he committed.

164
00:10:45,143 --> 00:10:46,640
After confessing,

165
00:10:46,793 --> 00:10:48,647
he took his own life out of fear.

166
00:10:50,337 --> 00:10:51,560
This case

167
00:10:52,475 --> 00:10:53,528
is closed.

168
00:10:53,744 --> 00:10:54,798
Yes.

169
00:10:54,943 --> 00:10:56,175
It's closed.

170
00:10:56,266 --> 00:10:58,625
Tomorrow I'll submit the case file to His Majesty.

171
00:10:58,716 --> 00:11:00,639
Censor Shen, you've worked hard today.

172
00:11:00,833 --> 00:11:02,498
Go home and get some rest.

173
00:11:06,568 --> 00:11:08,103
One life lost.

174
00:11:10,361 --> 00:11:11,894
One confession.

175
00:11:12,905 --> 00:11:14,958
Are you investigating a case

176
00:11:15,813 --> 00:11:17,386
or just silencing him?

177
00:11:36,112 --> 00:11:38,711
(I, Secretarial Censor Shen Xiao, )

178
00:11:38,802 --> 00:11:40,242
(am risking my life to report this.)

179
00:11:40,345 --> 00:11:41,799
(Supervisor Cai turned himself in, )

180
00:11:42,024 --> 00:11:44,119
(but died in prison before being questioned.)

181
00:11:44,457 --> 00:11:45,815
(There are many suspicious points.)

182
00:11:45,839 --> 00:11:47,599
(It seems like someone wanted him silenced.)

183
00:11:50,145 --> 00:11:52,865
(The Three Judicial Offices handled the case slowly and carelessly.)

184
00:11:53,425 --> 00:11:55,785
(They can't escape blame for negligence or even collusion.)

185
00:11:56,146 --> 00:11:57,877
(This case concerns the foundation of the nation.)

186
00:11:57,901 --> 00:12:00,421
(It's not something a single supervisor can take the fall for.)

187
00:12:03,889 --> 00:12:06,160
(I beg His Majesty to investigate this case thoroughly.)

188
00:12:06,625 --> 00:12:07,998
(Please get to the bottom of it)

189
00:12:08,224 --> 00:12:09,521
(so that the people can be at ease)

190
00:12:09,545 --> 00:12:11,040
(and restore order in the court.)

191
00:12:23,783 --> 00:12:25,361
By the imperial decree,

192
00:12:25,442 --> 00:12:27,585
Secretarial Censor Shen Xiao is ordered

193
00:12:27,665 --> 00:12:29,794
to lead the investigation of the unclaimed granary case

194
00:12:29,818 --> 00:12:31,857
and Supervisor Cai's suicide case.

195
00:12:31,948 --> 00:12:35,200
The Three Judicial Offices may assist without overstepping their authority.

196
00:12:35,334 --> 00:12:37,884
If anyone obstructs, they will be investigated as well.

197
00:12:37,975 --> 00:12:40,029
As you command, Your Majesty.

198
00:12:43,264 --> 00:12:44,501
As you command, Your Majesty.

199
00:13:00,545 --> 00:13:02,752
This is rebellion!

200
00:13:03,089 --> 00:13:04,864
That lowborn Shen Xiao.

201
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:08,600
He submitted three memorials in a row to accuse the Three Judicial Offices.

202
00:13:09,425 --> 00:13:10,662
It's clear

203
00:13:11,504 --> 00:13:13,525
that he's targeting me!

204
00:13:14,705 --> 00:13:15,904
Why not just...

205
00:13:16,041 --> 00:13:17,086
No.

206
00:13:17,167 --> 00:13:18,888
His Majesty is furious right now.

207
00:13:19,032 --> 00:13:22,126
If you kill him, you'll bring trouble to the Eastern Palace.

208
00:13:26,864 --> 00:13:29,919
Didn't he say Supervisor Cai wasn't powerful enough?

209
00:13:31,144 --> 00:13:32,381
Then I

210
00:13:34,288 --> 00:13:37,142
will give him someone who holds more power.

211
00:13:42,487 --> 00:13:44,600
(The Unclaimed Granary)

212
00:14:04,566 --> 00:14:07,679
Censor Shen, the suspect in the granary case has turned herself in.

213
00:14:41,705 --> 00:14:42,942
Why are you here?

214
00:14:43,085 --> 00:14:45,059
Aren't you investigating the case?

215
00:14:45,392 --> 00:14:47,231
The guard of the unclaimed granary

216
00:14:47,322 --> 00:14:49,042
is registered under the Princess Residence.

217
00:14:49,144 --> 00:14:51,870
So, I have become the suspect in this case.

218
00:14:52,730 --> 00:14:54,370
Is he going to use you as the scapegoat?

219
00:14:54,545 --> 00:14:56,318
I've always been just a pawn.

220
00:14:57,545 --> 00:14:59,299
Why not tell His Majesty?

221
00:14:59,545 --> 00:15:00,782
Where's the evidence?

222
00:15:01,273 --> 00:15:03,166
No evidence means it's just a false accusation.

223
00:15:03,665 --> 00:15:06,025
Those 500,000 bushels of grain have nothing to do with you.

224
00:15:07,665 --> 00:15:10,120
Since you are sure it has nothing to do with me,

225
00:15:10,256 --> 00:15:11,776
looks like you have nothing to ask.

226
00:15:11,905 --> 00:15:13,199
Then I'm going to bed.

227
00:15:22,104 --> 00:15:23,639
(How did it end up like this?)

228
00:15:38,504 --> 00:15:40,862
This bed is so hard. How am I supposed to sleep?

229
00:15:43,465 --> 00:15:45,848
I brought this from home. It's clean.

230
00:16:01,416 --> 00:16:04,351
Your Highness, please rest first. I have important matters to handle.

231
00:16:04,944 --> 00:16:06,407
Did I say you could leave?

232
00:16:23,864 --> 00:16:25,101
Stay and help me sleep.

233
00:16:27,336 --> 00:16:28,573
Now?

234
00:16:29,145 --> 00:16:30,758
Just do as you're told.

235
00:16:38,024 --> 00:16:39,261
Stop!

236
00:16:41,064 --> 00:16:42,301
Stop right there!

237
00:16:42,729 --> 00:16:44,080
You, stop right there.

238
00:16:44,465 --> 00:16:45,685
Xiao Que.

239
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,374
Censor Shen.

240
00:16:49,465 --> 00:16:51,704
This kid says she works for Princess Zhao Yang.

241
00:16:51,785 --> 00:16:53,022
I...

242
00:16:55,193 --> 00:16:56,274
Xiao Que, why are you here?

243
00:16:56,401 --> 00:16:57,894
I'm here to see you.

244
00:16:58,064 --> 00:16:59,932
Jian Xin is worried you can't sleep well.

245
00:17:00,047 --> 00:17:02,981
She asked me to bring some things here to keep you company.

246
00:17:04,936 --> 00:17:07,440
Why are you so mean?

247
00:17:07,544 --> 00:17:10,119
You took my money but refused to let me in.

248
00:17:17,017 --> 00:17:18,480
Hello, Censor Shen.

249
00:17:20,577 --> 00:17:22,756
I'll keep the things here. You should head back first.

250
00:17:23,071 --> 00:17:24,312
Censor Shen is busy.

251
00:17:24,416 --> 00:17:25,631
But I have plenty of time.

252
00:17:25,784 --> 00:17:27,958
Why can't I stay here?

253
00:17:34,145 --> 00:17:35,984
The Princess is precious.

254
00:17:36,064 --> 00:17:37,965
Make sure nothing happens to her.

255
00:17:38,081 --> 00:17:40,120
Not even a scratch.

256
00:17:40,262 --> 00:17:42,224
Or lose even a bit of weight.

257
00:17:42,415 --> 00:17:45,142
Otherwise, I won't forgive you!

258
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:49,399
Censor Shen, Jian Xin told me to tell you this.

259
00:17:50,425 --> 00:17:51,662
Got it.

260
00:17:56,504 --> 00:17:59,198
Oh, right. There's something really important.

261
00:17:59,528 --> 00:18:03,000
When the Princess sleeps alone, she always has nightmares.

262
00:18:03,304 --> 00:18:06,919
Jian Xin said she'll be fine if Censor Shen is there.

263
00:18:07,827 --> 00:18:11,561
Make sure to stay by the Princess's side at night.

264
00:18:13,504 --> 00:18:15,119
I'll definitely stay by her side.

265
00:18:17,984 --> 00:18:19,221
Enough.

266
00:18:19,744 --> 00:18:22,077
When did you get as chatty as Jian Xin?

267
00:18:22,208 --> 00:18:24,807
Copy some calligraphy 100 times as punishment. Do you hear me?

268
00:18:24,916 --> 00:18:27,200
Once you're done, I'll come and check on your work.

269
00:18:27,705 --> 00:18:28,942
Really?

270
00:18:29,345 --> 00:18:31,224
Have I ever broken a promise?

271
00:18:31,304 --> 00:18:33,464
Alright. I'll go and copy them right now.

272
00:18:33,590 --> 00:18:35,405
Make sure to come back soon, Your Highness.

273
00:18:39,057 --> 00:18:41,689
Censor Shen. When the Princess wakes up in the morning,

274
00:18:41,770 --> 00:18:43,920
she likes to wash her face with cold water.

275
00:18:46,145 --> 00:18:48,135
Also, before the Princess eats,

276
00:18:48,216 --> 00:18:49,990
she must have some osmanthus tea.

277
00:18:56,636 --> 00:18:57,808
When the Princess drinks tea,

278
00:18:57,889 --> 00:18:59,717
she needs to eat golden milk pastries with it.

279
00:18:59,741 --> 00:19:03,359
They must be freshly made from Yuyi Pastry House.

280
00:19:04,145 --> 00:19:05,382
Got it.

281
00:19:14,024 --> 00:19:15,438
Your Highness,

282
00:19:15,664 --> 00:19:18,438
I'll go and handle those files.

283
00:19:18,594 --> 00:19:19,831
Wait.

284
00:19:20,425 --> 00:19:22,799
Didn't you hear what Xiao Que said?

285
00:19:23,425 --> 00:19:25,521
You can't let me go hungry, not even a bit.

286
00:19:25,863 --> 00:19:27,158
I'm hungry now.

287
00:19:29,744 --> 00:19:30,981
Alright.

288
00:19:33,951 --> 00:19:35,360
I'm thirsty.

289
00:19:37,641 --> 00:19:38,960
It's too hot.

290
00:19:45,105 --> 00:19:46,342
I don't want it anymore.

291
00:19:46,544 --> 00:19:47,781
I'm sleepy.

292
00:19:59,625 --> 00:20:00,862
Listen to me.

293
00:20:01,729 --> 00:20:02,966
Stop investigating.

294
00:20:04,297 --> 00:20:05,831
I'm afraid I can't protect you.

295
00:20:08,345 --> 00:20:10,478
It's late, go to sleep.

296
00:20:13,825 --> 00:20:15,239
I'll go and get the files.

297
00:20:15,984 --> 00:20:17,504
Then I'll come back and stay with you.

298
00:20:21,544 --> 00:20:23,599
(I knew you'd be like this.)

299
00:20:24,665 --> 00:20:26,359
(Glad you haven't changed.)

300
00:20:27,905 --> 00:20:30,958
(What I liked about you back then was your honesty and courage.)

301
00:20:31,345 --> 00:20:32,958
(But people like you)

302
00:20:33,465 --> 00:20:35,518
(are really a headache sometimes.)

303
00:21:01,241 --> 00:21:02,478
What's wrong?

304
00:21:10,304 --> 00:21:14,157
The Crown Prince pinned the unclaimed granary case all on you.

305
00:21:15,431 --> 00:21:17,960
He even accused us of killing Supervisor Cai

306
00:21:18,149 --> 00:21:20,043
to frame the Crown Prince.

307
00:21:20,649 --> 00:21:22,360
The impeachment memorial against us

308
00:21:22,577 --> 00:21:24,551
will reach His Majesty before dawn.

309
00:21:27,385 --> 00:21:28,702
It has come to this.

310
00:21:29,192 --> 00:21:30,553
He's using you to take the fall.

311
00:21:30,665 --> 00:21:32,438
Will you not step up and accuse him?

312
00:21:32,945 --> 00:21:34,559
Don't you get it yet?

313
00:21:35,304 --> 00:21:36,998
Taking the blame for the Crown Prince

314
00:21:37,788 --> 00:21:39,803
is my role in the Eastern Palace.

315
00:21:40,489 --> 00:21:43,583
If I hadn't always been cautious and humble,

316
00:21:44,197 --> 00:21:46,092
I would've died countless times.

317
00:21:48,504 --> 00:21:49,741
Shen Xiao.

318
00:21:49,905 --> 00:21:51,825
How old were you when you first saw someone die?

319
00:21:54,145 --> 00:21:55,718
I was eight.

320
00:21:57,667 --> 00:21:59,240
My mother was gravely ill.

321
00:21:59,553 --> 00:22:00,926
She was afraid she'd drag me down.

322
00:22:01,641 --> 00:22:03,414
So, she hanged herself in the Cold Palace.

323
00:22:05,894 --> 00:22:08,029
Mother!

324
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:10,015
That year, the wind and snow were brutal.

325
00:22:10,872 --> 00:22:13,219
She didn't even have a straw mat.

326
00:22:20,049 --> 00:22:21,904
But that's the palace life.

327
00:22:24,888 --> 00:22:27,023
That's how cruel this world is.

328
00:22:28,648 --> 00:22:29,969
It's the same everywhere.

329
00:22:30,082 --> 00:22:32,681
I'm begging you, please help me.

330
00:22:32,824 --> 00:22:35,040
I knelt there for hours with no sense of time.

331
00:22:35,841 --> 00:22:37,480
Just begging for a bundle of firewood

332
00:22:37,905 --> 00:22:39,559
so I could cremate my mother.

333
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,157
That way,

334
00:22:42,338 --> 00:22:45,160
she could return to Earth as dust.

335
00:22:47,097 --> 00:22:48,352
I hope she could

336
00:22:48,897 --> 00:22:50,871
end up somewhere warm in her next life.

337
00:22:53,025 --> 00:22:54,480
Without my mother,

338
00:22:54,817 --> 00:22:56,860
life in the Cold Palace got even harder.

339
00:22:57,304 --> 00:22:59,798
Every day, I woke up to endless chores.

340
00:23:00,305 --> 00:23:01,840
Not just that,

341
00:23:02,503 --> 00:23:05,120
I was bullied by the cruel servants too.

342
00:23:07,705 --> 00:23:10,079
But I always remembered what my mother said.

343
00:23:10,487 --> 00:23:12,113
Live well.

344
00:23:12,304 --> 00:23:14,392
Make it out of the Cold Palace alive.

345
00:23:15,625 --> 00:23:16,862
Back then,

346
00:23:17,393 --> 00:23:20,240
the Crown Prince, who was rising to power, was my only hope.

347
00:23:21,001 --> 00:23:24,506
So I did everything I could to get close to him, trying to please him.

348
00:23:24,881 --> 00:23:27,632
If you can take my whip, I'll let you stay.

349
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,694
The scar on my shoulder

350
00:23:31,224 --> 00:23:32,958
came from that moment.

351
00:23:35,857 --> 00:23:37,430
As long as I survived,

352
00:23:40,063 --> 00:23:41,783
as long as I could leave the Cold Palace...

353
00:23:41,824 --> 00:23:43,351
Awesome!

354
00:23:44,504 --> 00:23:46,919
- Nice hit! - Even if I had to be a dog,

355
00:23:47,224 --> 00:23:48,679
I'd do it.

356
00:23:52,561 --> 00:23:54,734
I didn't get this far by luck.

357
00:23:55,128 --> 00:23:56,543
It was by calculation.

358
00:23:56,904 --> 00:23:58,584
Figuring out everyone's motives.

359
00:23:58,768 --> 00:24:00,504
Weighing the price of every step.

360
00:24:00,931 --> 00:24:03,680
I escaped the Cold Palace not just to die somewhere else.

361
00:24:03,857 --> 00:24:05,351
I want to live.

362
00:24:05,657 --> 00:24:07,271
And I want to live my best life.

363
00:24:09,145 --> 00:24:11,065
Of course I want to bring down the Crown Prince.

364
00:24:11,760 --> 00:24:13,135
But first,

365
00:24:13,274 --> 00:24:15,160
the winner has to be me.

366
00:24:15,544 --> 00:24:17,713
The last one standing has to be me.

367
00:24:18,281 --> 00:24:19,615
Only by staying alive

368
00:24:19,807 --> 00:24:21,342
can I have a shot at winning.

369
00:24:22,345 --> 00:24:23,582
Right?

370
00:24:27,601 --> 00:24:29,376
His Majesty isn't stupid.

371
00:24:29,861 --> 00:24:31,140
He knows everything.

372
00:24:31,271 --> 00:24:32,725
He sent you to investigate

373
00:24:32,857 --> 00:24:34,777
just to put pressure on the Crown Prince

374
00:24:34,900 --> 00:24:36,179
and keep the court balanced.

375
00:24:36,359 --> 00:24:38,095
You, me,

376
00:24:38,227 --> 00:24:39,561
and even the Crown Prince

377
00:24:40,004 --> 00:24:41,983
are just the pieces he uses to balance the state.

378
00:24:42,135 --> 00:24:43,869
As for those 500,000 bushels of grain,

379
00:24:44,145 --> 00:24:46,600
they are just the tip of the Crown Prince's stash.

380
00:24:47,705 --> 00:24:49,958
The real reason he's stockpiling grain

381
00:24:50,428 --> 00:24:51,763
is to raise an army.

382
00:24:56,049 --> 00:24:58,103
He's the heir, why would he need an army?

383
00:24:58,641 --> 00:25:01,359
Could it be His Majesty has changed his mind?

384
00:25:03,935 --> 00:25:05,870
His Majesty hasn't abandoned the Crown Prince.

385
00:25:06,245 --> 00:25:07,802
But he can't tolerate the noble families either.

386
00:25:07,826 --> 00:25:09,866
The Crown Prince is tied to the nobles too tightly.

387
00:25:10,136 --> 00:25:13,094
So, if he wants to depose the Crown Prince, the only way is

388
00:25:14,809 --> 00:25:16,263
to force him to rebel.

389
00:25:20,139 --> 00:25:22,344
What we're up against isn't just the Crown Prince.

390
00:25:22,689 --> 00:25:24,930
It's a tangled, massive beast.

391
00:25:25,037 --> 00:25:27,090
One wrong move and we'll lose everything.

392
00:25:27,865 --> 00:25:29,320
Do you understand?

393
00:25:29,529 --> 00:25:30,766
I get it.

394
00:25:32,024 --> 00:25:33,919
So what's your next move?

395
00:25:36,129 --> 00:25:37,960
With Father being so furious,

396
00:25:38,281 --> 00:25:40,992
I'll probably lose my title and be punished.

397
00:25:42,504 --> 00:25:44,878
But as long as you and Le Sheng are still in court,

398
00:25:45,345 --> 00:25:46,664
we still have a chance.

399
00:25:46,831 --> 00:25:48,085
We haven't lost.

400
00:25:54,225 --> 00:25:55,921
(Eastern Palace)

401
00:25:56,656 --> 00:25:58,311
You sent Zhao Yang to prison.

402
00:25:59,888 --> 00:26:03,594
Are you going to pin all 500,000 bushels of grain on her?

403
00:26:03,705 --> 00:26:05,935
That's her duty in the Eastern Palace.

404
00:26:06,248 --> 00:26:07,863
Supervisor Cai is dead.

405
00:26:08,264 --> 00:26:09,879
But Shen Xiao refuses to let it go.

406
00:26:10,784 --> 00:26:13,280
No one suits taking the blame better than her.

407
00:26:14,304 --> 00:26:15,828
You know that very well.

408
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,680
- Your Highness. - Enough.

409
00:26:18,768 --> 00:26:21,103
Zhao Yang going to prison is just the beginning.

410
00:26:21,952 --> 00:26:23,320
This fire

411
00:26:25,024 --> 00:26:27,319
needs to burn even hotter.

412
00:26:30,577 --> 00:26:32,107
What do you mean?

413
00:26:32,321 --> 00:26:34,322
If Zhao Yang dies in prison

414
00:26:35,185 --> 00:26:36,960
and accuses Shen Xiao

415
00:26:37,624 --> 00:26:39,678
for murdering her in her last words...

416
00:26:40,672 --> 00:26:43,166
A top scholar from a humble family kills a princess.

417
00:26:43,425 --> 00:26:44,704
What a perfect ending.

418
00:26:44,784 --> 00:26:46,021
Are you going to kill her?

419
00:26:46,329 --> 00:26:49,408
She's served you for years! How could you go this far, Your Highness?

420
00:26:49,539 --> 00:26:51,038
She doesn't deserve it.

421
00:26:51,465 --> 00:26:53,940
But a filthy commoner thinks he can take me down.

422
00:26:54,313 --> 00:26:55,632
I won't allow it.

423
00:26:55,713 --> 00:26:58,083
Your Highness. This is way too risky.

424
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:01,559
If the Princess dies, His Majesty will definitely investigate it.

425
00:27:01,583 --> 00:27:04,507
So we need to lock everything in place before Father starts digging.

426
00:27:11,055 --> 00:27:12,388
Cui Jin Zhi.

427
00:27:13,105 --> 00:27:16,199
The Cui family has long been tied to the Eastern Palace.

428
00:27:17,665 --> 00:27:19,319
Are you going

429
00:27:19,984 --> 00:27:23,185
throw away a century of your family's legacy for a woman?

430
00:27:24,544 --> 00:27:26,877
Save your useless pity.

431
00:27:27,257 --> 00:27:28,791
After tonight,

432
00:27:29,873 --> 00:27:31,720
there will be no more Zhao Yang.

433
00:27:39,304 --> 00:27:40,541
I understand,

434
00:27:42,105 --> 00:27:43,342
Your Highness.

435
00:28:01,033 --> 00:28:04,480
(The Ministry of Justice Prison)
